.TH xml_reader 3
.SH NAME
xml_reader \- initialize XML reader
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "xml.h"
.PP
.BI "void xml_reader(xmlreader *" r ", buffer *" b ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B xml_reader
initializes the XML reader structure
.I r
to read from the buffer
.IR b .
It sets up the initial document node and parent tracking.